Apple is accepting pre-orders for the <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/airpods-max/">AirPods Max 2</a> headphones that <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/2026/03/16/apple-announces-airpods-max-2/">were introduced on March 16</a>, with a purchase option now available <a href="https://www.apple.com/shop/buy-airpods/airpods-max-2">on the Apple.com website</a>.<br/>
<br/>
<img class="aligncenter size-full wp-image-1040883" src="https://images.macrumors.com/article-new/2026/03/AirPods-Max-2-Feature.jpg" alt="" width="1920" height="1080" /><br/>
In the U.S., Apple's online store lists a delivery timeframe of April 1 to April 3.<br/>
<br/>
Priced at &#36;549, the &zwnj;AirPods Max 2&zwnj; feature the same design as the original AirPods Max, but Apple updated the over-ear headphones with an H2 chip that adds new capabilities already offered by other AirPods models.<br/>
<br/>
